        m_KeyId: 2573444202511
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: MML saved in the level (MMLS), which changes engine settings while it''s played. The original Marathon 2 and Infinity ignore it. Kept and saved as it is.'
