      data:
        m_KeyId: 1428817863917569
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Change the environment to {0}?
    - rid: 552786204080472177
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1428817863917570
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Marathon 2 and Infinity only load the environment's walls, {0}. Moving the textures moves every texture, control panel and media from {1} to {0}. Keeping them leaves them on {1}, which only Aleph One loads.
    - rid: 552786204080472178
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1428817863917571
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Change the landscape to {0}?
    - rid: 552786204080472179
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1428817863917572
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Marathon 2 and Infinity only load the level's landscape, {0}. Moving the textures moves every landscape texture from {1} to {0}. Keeping them leaves them on {1}, which only Aleph One loads.
    - rid: 552786204080472180
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1428817863917573
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Textures
    - rid: 552786204080472181
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 1428817863917574
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Keep Textures (Aleph One Only)
    - rid: 552786204080472182
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890688
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Saved in the level and in the map's list of levels. It can't be emptied, as a level with no name ends the list.
    - rid: 552786204080472183
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890689
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Its walls and scenery collections. Choosing another offers to move the level's textures (and control panels and media) to the new walls collection.
    - rid: 552786204080472184
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890690
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The landscape collection the level's song index picks. Choosing another offers to move the level's landscape textures to it.
    - rid: 552786204080472185
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890691
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The physics model number saved in the level's data
    - rid: 552786204080472186
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890692
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Where the physics the level is shown with come from: the level''s own, the selected physics file (Files tab), or the engine''s defaults'
    - rid: 552786204080472187
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890693
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in single player games
    - rid: 552786204080472188
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890694
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in cooperative network games
    - rid: 552786204080472189
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890695
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in Every Man for Himself (carnage) network games
    - rid: 552786204080472190
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890696
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in Kill the Man with the Ball network games
    - rid: 552786204080472191
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890697
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in King of the Hill network games (it needs hill polygons)
    - rid: 552786204080472192
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890698
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in Defense network games (it needs base polygons)
    - rid: 552786204080472193
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890699
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in Rugby network games (it needs base polygons)
    - rid: 552786204080472194
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890700
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level can be played in Capture the Flag network games (it needs base polygons)
    - rid: 552786204080472195
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890701
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'There''s no air: the player uses oxygen the whole time, and some weapons don''t work'
    - rid: 552786204080472196
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890702
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The motion sensor works poorly
    - rid: 552786204080472197
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890703
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The BOBs fight the Pfhor, and the player starts without their items and health
    - rid: 552786204080472198
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890704
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Gravity is lower than usual
    - rid: 552786204080472199
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890705
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level is finished once its aliens are dead
    - rid: 552786204080472200
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890706
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level is finished once the player has been in each of its Must Be Explored polygons
    - rid: 552786204080472201
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890707
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level is finished once the player has picked up its items to retrieve
    - rid: 552786204080472202
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890708
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level is finished once its repair switches are switched on
    - rid: 552786204080472203
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890709
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The level is finished once its BOBs are rescued
    - rid: 552786204080472204
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890710
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: time stops while the player reads a terminal (in single player games)'
    - rid: 552786204080472205
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890711
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: Marathon 1''s rebellion, which doesn''t take away the player''s items and health'
    - rid: 552786204080472206
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890712
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: Marathon 1''s exploration mission (Aleph One sets it on a Marathon 1 level''s exploration missions)'
    - rid: 552786204080472207
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890713
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: Marathon 1''s repair mission (Aleph One sets it on a Marathon 1 level''s repair missions)'
    - rid: 552786204080472208
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151319883890714
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: Marathon 1''s rescue mission (Aleph One sets it on a Marathon 1 level''s rescue missions)'
    - rid: 552786204080472209
